+// Travel transition: the screen fades to black while a goblin with a backpack walks across, then the travel
+// runs (the load happens behind the black screen), then it fades back in on the destination map. One
+// persistent obj_empty (gnx_travel_fx) carries it through the room change.
+// phase 0 = fading out, 1 = travelling (black until the new map is up), 2 = fading in
+function scr_gnx_travel_fx_start(arg0, arg1)
+{
